  Nothing in res/drawable carried this shape - the download arrow is straight down and the only
  circular arrow is the refresh glyph - so the entry gets this one. An import turns an outside file
  back towards the calendar it is added to, which is the undo arrow, and the menu's own runtime tint
  makes it follow the bar's colour whatever the theme is; the fill is the theme's control colour so
  the icon is also right anywhere that tint is not applied.
-->
